{"Title":"An Act authorizing the administrative assistant to the board of assessors of the city of New Bedford to be a non-resident","BillNumber":"H4201","DocketNumber":"HD4695","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"AFC1","Name":"Antonio F. D. Cabral","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AFC1","ResponseDate":"2023-11-15T15:37:04.02"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"AFC1","Name":"Antonio F. D. Cabral","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AFC1","ResponseDate":"2023-11-15T15:37:04.02"},{"Id":"MCM0","Name":"Mark C. Montigny","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MCM0","ResponseDate":"2023-11-16T16:39:43.9533333"},{"Id":"C_H1","Name":"Christopher Hendricks","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/C_H1","ResponseDate":"2023-11-17T12:46:11.8866667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4201/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Cabral of New Bedford, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 4201) of Antonio F. D. Cabral, Mark C. Montigny and Christopher Hendricks (with the approval of the mayor and city council) that the city of New Bedford be authorized to employ a non-resident as the administrative assistant to the board of assessors of said city.  Municipalities and Regional Government.  [Local Approval Received.]","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Notwithstanding Chapter 5 of the Acts of 1990, or any general or special law to the contrary, the Administrative Assistant to the Board of Assessors of the City of New Bedford may be a non-resident of the City of New Bedford.\r\n\tSECTION 2. This act shall take effect upon its passage. \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J10","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J10"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S31","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S31"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}